    "q-111519": {
      "dom_id": "step-q111519",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "The random variable $X$ has the following probability distribution.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $10$ | $20$ | $30$ | $40$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $\\frac{5}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\nLet $Y=\\frac{X}{10}-1.$ The distribution of $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $y$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $c$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $a$ | $b$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $d$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\nWhat is the value of $a+b+c?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's add a $Y=\\frac{X}{10}-1$ row to our table.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $10$ | $20$ | $30$ | $40$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $\\frac{5}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, ${f}_{X}(x)={f}_{Y}(y)$ for corresponding values of $X$ and $Y.$ Therefore, the distribution of $Y$ is as follows:\n\n| $y$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{5}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\nSo, we have $a=\\frac{5}{12},b=\\frac{1}{12},c=1,$ and therefore $a+b+c=\\frac{3}{2}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-111519-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{5}{2}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"172\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
