    "q-149763": {
      "dom_id": "step-q149763",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "The random variable $X$ has the following probability distribution.\n\n| $x$ | $-1.5$ | $-0.5$ | $0.5$ | $1.5$ | $2.5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{3}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\nLet $Y=5-2X.$ The distribution of $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $y$ | $a$ | $6$ | $b$ | $2$ | $0$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $c$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $d$ |\n\nWhat is the value of $a+c+d?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's add a $Y=5-2X$ row to our table.\n\n| $x$ | $-1.5$ | $-0.5$ | $0.5$ | $1.5$ | $2.5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $8$ | $6$ | $4$ | $2$ | $0$ |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{3}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, ${f}_{X}(x)={f}_{Y}(y)$ for corresponding values of $X$ and $Y.$ Therefore, the distribution of $Y$ is as follows:\n\n| $y$ | $8$ | $6$ | $4$ | $2$ | $0$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{3}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n\nSo, we have $a=8,c=\\frac{1}{3},d=\\frac{1}{6},$ and therefore $a+c+d=\\frac{17}{2}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-149763-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{14}{3}",
              "html": " <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"243\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-149763-b",
