e=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
